{"games":[{"id":136895082736531,"name":"Build a Tower with Friends","desc":"You can start building the tower from scratch! Create a Free private server in the \"Servers\" tab at the bottom this page\n👇👇👇\n\n🏗️Build the tallest tower!\n\n⛏️Mine\n🔨Cut\n🧱Place\n⬆️Upgrade\n\n🔃To reset your tower, write \"/iwantresetmytower\" in the chat or in the console (enable it in the settings)\n⚠️This can be done once every 2 weeks\n\nAnd thank you for your likes, we are very pleased❤️\n\nThe idea for the game is taken from the [Social Game] world called \"Monument\" by Sylan Troh\nI want to say that I do not appropriate this idea to myself,\nI was greatly inspired by this idea and decided to try to create it in Roblox,\nin the future the place will be very different","path":"/game/136895082736531-build-a-tower-with-friends","slug":"136895082736531-build-a-tower-with-friends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2b178d0057faa7e96ff730ee4ffda46235f98b4689b679f0b1f494b6cb247fd9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f82f2a30dabe8720439630350d6965c6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":8772751,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-28T13:42:08.296Z","creator":{"name":"- Chick Production -","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":116635984204928,"name":"💣 حرب القنابل الاصلي (تحديث الميمز⌛)","desc":"💣 حرب القنابل الأصلي \n\nاستعد للدخول في أقوى معارك القنابل! ⚔️🔥\nاختبر مهاراتك في القتال والتكتيك ضد لاعبين حقيقيين، وكن آخر واحد صامد في الساحة 💣\n\n🆕 تحديث جديد: إزالة اللاج \nتم تحسين الأداء بشكل كبير لتجربة لعب أسرع وأنعم بدون تقطيع 🚀\n\n🎮 مميزات الماب:\n\n* قتال حماسي وسريع\n* تحديات مستمرة مع لاعبين أونلاين\n* أسلحة وقنابل متنوعة 💣\n* تحديثات مستمرة وتحسينات قوية\n\nهل تقدر تسيطر على ساحة المعركة وتفوز؟ 💥","path":"/game/116635984204928-game","slug":"116635984204928-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/880293aeda57808d4d5a5d8418058774e22b2ecfebd67187e74729a5d99bea59.webp","original":"https://tr.r