nk devs.\n\ntags:\nink game, ink, games, squid,squid games, qte practice., qte, quick time event, squid ink game, Mingle Practice, sky squid game, sky, sky squid game practice, sky squid game, the sky practice, best practice","path":"/game/111035118670623-the-sky-practice","slug":"111035118670623-the-sky-practice","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1c0143a476cd4d9db19adb8229d91b6af5e9f4459bef34c07f3d17e17979cf04.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5fa779a05c4c93bbfec06ca8dc9d8e00/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":3513210,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-01T19:46:07.530Z","creator":{"name":"just games i think","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":74404678581724,"name":"Crowd Playground","desc":"Play & experiment with a crowd algorithm!","path":"/game/74404678581724-crowd-playground","slug":"74404678581724-crowd-playground","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/03782dea878638a35a19b8808f3310bee50507fc01926e3628640e15cf36b805.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6a5829979bdb1e72f4589d6a516c9c36/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":7407175,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-23T01:01:49.329Z","creator":{"name":"mPhase","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14746343732,"name":"TashTram - Трамвай Ташкента","desc":"Симулятор трамвая, троллейбуса и автобуса. Ташкентский трамвай.\nTram, trolleybus and bus simulator. Tashkent tram.\n\nПолучите удовольствие от поездки по маршрутам Ташкентского трамвая, троллейбуса или автобуса.\n\nВ следующем обновлении:\n+ Новые линии маршрутов.\n+ Новые модели трамваев.\n+ Небольшая детализация городской среды. \n\nСообщайте о проблеме, если она возникла. Хорошей поездки!\n\nNext update:\n+ New route lines\n+ New models of trams\n+ Small detailing of the urban environment.\n\nLet me know if there is a problem. Have a good trip!\n","path":"/game/14746343732-tashtram"